### Sample requests (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client)
@base = http://localhost:5001/api/v1

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Login (copy accessToken into @token below)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@doctortracker.dev", "password": "Admin@12345" }

@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Refresh (cookie jar required)
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh

### Me
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Doctors: search + filter + sort + paginate
GET {{base}}/doctors?q=car&specialization=Cardiology,Neurology&sort=-patientCount&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Doctors: options and facets
GET {{base}}/doctors/options?q=an&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/doctors/facets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create doctor
POST {{base}}/doctors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Dr. Ayesha Rahman", "specialization": "Cardiology", "hospital": "Square Hospital", "phone": "+8801711000000", "email": "ayesha@example.com" }

### Doctor detail (replace id)
GET {{base}}/doctors/66f0c0000000000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Patients of a doctor
GET {{base}}/doctors/66f0c0000000000000000000/patients?condition=critical
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add patient to a doctor
POST {{base}}/doctors/66f0c0000000000000000000/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Rina Akter", "age": 31, "gender": "female", "phone": "+8801811223344", "diagnosis": "Migraine", "condition": "under_observation", "visitDate": "2026-11-18" }

### Patients: combined filters
GET {{base}}/patients?q=kar&condition=critical,recovering&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&sort=-visitDate&page=2&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard
GET {{base}}/dashboard/summary?range=30d
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/dashboard/patients-over-time?range=12m
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/dashboard/patients-per-doctor?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/dashboard/condition-distribution
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/dashboard/specialization-distribution?limit=8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/dashboard/recent-patients?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
